#: src/onboarding.py:466
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> "
"automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan uw {} automatisch ontgrendelen met behulp van "
"gezichtsauthenticatie (gedetecteerde portemonnee: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> TPM-hardware gedetecteerd. <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatisch "
"installeren..."

#: src/onboarding.py:478
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active. Your password will be securely "
"sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan uw {} automatisch ontgrendelen met behulp van "
"gezichtsauthenticatie (gedetecteerde portemonnee: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> Hardware-TPM 2.0 actief. Uw wachtwoord wordt veilig "
"verzegeld in de TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:480
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, but automatic installation of "
"<i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. "
"Falling back to software-based credential caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan uw {} automatisch ontgrendelen met behulp van "
"gezichtsauthenticatie (gedetecteerde portemonnee: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> TPM-hardware gedetecteerd, maar automatische installatie "
"van <i>tpm2-tools</i> is mislukt. Voer <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</"
"code> uit. Terugvallen op op software gebaseerde caching van inloggegevens."

#: src/onboarding.py:482
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authentication "
"(detected wallet: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detected. Using software-based credential "
"caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello kan uw {} automatisch ontgrendelen met behulp van "
"gezichtsauthenticatie (gedetecteerde portemonnee: {}).\n"
"\n"
"<b>TPM-status:</b> Er is geen TPM-hardware gedetecteerd. Met behulp van "
"softwaregebaseerde inloggegevenscaching (AES-256-GCM)."

